0 // Description: Wide 8 x 16 stud deck on Technic rails and axles with 55982/56891 off-road wheels.
0 // Parts: 46 (all inside the grouped submodel wide-offroad-base.ldr)
0 // Wheels: 4 (rim + tyre pairs on two axles)
0 // Bounds LDU: x -128..128, y -54..46, z -160..160 (size 256 x 100 x 320)
0 // Front / bow towards -Z, -Y up. The whole base is one submodel reference: move it as one piece.
1 16 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 wide-offroad-base.ldr
0 NOFILE
